## Dangerous-goods labeling (GHS vs TDG)

- When asked about transport labels, GHS pictograms, 副危, 分类鉴定, or MSDS Section 2 vs 14: follow Skill `.cursor/skills/dg-ghs-tdg-labeling/SKILL.md`, then `knowledge/07-compliance/ghs-pictograms.md` and `ghs-tdg-mapping.md`.
- Transport marks follow TDG (classification report + SDS §14), not GHS pictograms alone.

## Do not

- Put durable business facts only in chat.
- Override compliance/safety for cost savings.
- Pretend ERP/TMS live data exists unless described in `knowledge/08-systems/`.
- Ask the user to re-paste tables that already exist as Databases under MK数据库 (unless MCP quota blocks reads).